==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Pigge]]s spawn, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Pigge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20~25 seconds<sup>600f~750f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Pigge]]s spawn after 15 seconds<sup>450f</sup>, delay 20~25 seconds<sup>600f~750f</sup>.
*1 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*1 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]] spawns after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*2 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A pretty easy stage. Bring any [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Reds]] or [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win. As with any Timed Score stage, units with quick movement speed help achieve a high score.

